Service identification marks bundled in the Client APK

These marks identify the corresponding third-party services. They are not
Zombie Box logos and do not imply endorsement. Their trademark and brand rules
remain with their owners; the first-party GPL license does not relicense them.
The PNG files in drawable-nodpi are size-reduced, aspect-preserving copies of
the listed official assets for legacy Android decoding.

